cff-version: 1.2.0
message: "If you use this software, please cite the SplitAligner preprint below. The immutable v0.1.0 release passed independent Pro RECERT; this 0.1.0.9000 source is post-release development and is not covered by that decision."
title: "SplitAlignerR: R Interface and Independent Graph Oracle for SplitAligner"
abstract: "SplitAlignerR post-v0.1.0 development of the SplitAligner branch-coordinate framework, with a C++17 production mapper, a separate pure R Catnip10 graph Oracle, strict finite-range numeric validation, and audit-ready paired-output provenance."
